1
00:00:00,143 --> 00:00:01,213
(Penny:)Right.

2
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:02,910
(Amy:)So where are we going?

3
00:00:02,912 --> 00:00:06,412
(Sheldon:)No, I meant turn right,
and you missed it.

4
00:00:06,416 --> 00:00:09,086
(Sheldon:)Maybe you do need to know.

5
00:00:11,387 --> 00:00:13,417
(indistinct chatter)

6
00:00:13,423 --> 00:00:14,623
(Leonard:)What are we gonna tell
the girls?

7
00:00:14,624 --> 00:00:15,794
(Howard:)It's not a problem.

8
00:00:15,792 --> 00:00:16,922
(Leonard:)I mean without lying.

9
00:00:16,926 --> 00:00:19,296
(Howard:)And now you've made it
a problem.

10
00:00:19,295 --> 00:00:21,365
(Leonard:)Come on. We're
a couple of smart guys.

11
00:00:21,364 --> 00:00:23,234
(Leonard:)I'm sure we can come up
with a way to explain this

12
00:00:23,232 --> 00:00:24,902
(Leonard:)that doesn't make us
look bad.

13
00:00:24,901 --> 00:00:26,771
(phone chimes)

14
00:00:26,769 --> 00:00:28,699
Oh!

15
00:00:28,705 --> 00:00:30,505
(Penny(at Howard's workshop, reading text):)The boys had to drive
all the way to San Bernardino

16
00:00:30,506 --> 00:00:32,336
(Penny(at Howard's workshop, reading text):)for the solder and got a flat.

17
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:35,440
(phone chimes)

18
00:00:35,445 --> 00:00:37,845
(Leonard:)They bought it.

19
00:00:37,847 --> 00:00:39,417
(Howard:)But we're gonna have to

20
00:00:39,415 --> 00:00:41,045
(Howard:)put the spare on
before we go back.

21
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,750
(Leonard:)Oh, you're good at this.

22
00:00:42,752 --> 00:00:45,082
(Howard:)Well, I lie a lot.

23
00:00:45,922 --> 00:00:47,592
MAN:
Hey, guys, thank you

24
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:49,520
(Man:)for being a part of our
test screening. You're about

25
00:00:49,525 --> 00:00:52,225
(Man:)to be one of the first audiences
to see Suicide Squad.

26
00:00:52,228 --> 00:00:54,198
(applause and cheering)
Hey!

27
00:00:54,197 --> 00:00:55,467
(laughs)
You were right.

28
00:00:55,465 --> 00:00:56,595
Oh, I keep telling you...

29
00:00:56,599 --> 00:01:00,139
(Howard:)good things happen
to bad people.

